143
00:07:12.235 --> 00:07:15.030
Why a state transition shouldn't be a generic PUT.

144
00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:22.542
PUT or orders or 42 status:CANCELLED lets clients set any status, including invalid ones like DELIVERED.

145
00:07:22.822 --> 00:07:34.705
An explicit POST or orders or 42 or cancel models the business action, carries its own rules (only before packing), and can have its own permissions, audit trail and idempotency.

