00:15:18.007 --> 00:15:19.287
Idempotency keys.

322
00:15:19.567 --> 00:15:25.946
A client generates a unique key (a UUID) per logical operation and sends it with the request.

323
00:15:26.226 --> 00:15:28.359
The server stores the key with the outcome.

324
00:15:28.639 --> 00:15:33.077
Retries with the same key return the same outcome without re-executing.

