653
00:34:05.837 --> 00:34:07.287
WD to DB:

654
00:34:07.567 --> 00:34:12.943
INSERT delivery(eventid, endpoint, attempt 0), unique on event+endpoint.

655
00:34:13.223 --> 00:34:14.439
WD to S:

656
00:34:14.719 --> 00:34:22.570
POST or hooks, Grocery-Signature t=..v1=HMAC(secret, t.body), event id evt1.

657
00:34:22.850 --> 00:34:24.130
