674
00:35:14.543 --> 00:35:15.183
1.

675
00:35:15.463 --> 00:35:16.871
Context and Problem.

676
00:35:17.151 --> 00:35:21.545
Duplicate orders and payments from client retries (§1.1).

677
00:35:21.825 --> 00:35:26.668
Offset pagination on order history degraded as heavy users' histories grew.

678
00:35:26.948 --> 00:35:32.111
There were no conditional updates, and error responses were inconsistent across services.

679
00:35:32.391 --> 00:35:33.095
2.

680
00:35:33.375 --> 00:35:34.719
Goals or Non-Goals.

681
00:35:34.999 --> 00:35:46.092
Goals: retry-safe creation and actions; stable, fast pagination; concurrency-safe state changes; one error model; a contract-first spec with SDKs.

682
00:35:47.442 --> 00:35:55.741
Non-goals: checkout orchestration internals (Ch 13, 46); GraphQL (revisit per §2.11).

683
00:35:56.021 --> 00:35:56.767
3.

684
00:35:57.047 --> 00:35:58.007
Requirements.

685
00:35:59.357 --> 00:36:00.701
Here is a quick table:

686
00:36:00.981 --> 00:36:02.453
ID, and Requirement.

687
00:36:02.733 --> 00:36:03.672
FR-1:

688
00:36:03.952 --> 00:36:08.112
Create an order from a cart (POST or api or v1 or orders).

689
00:36:08.392 --> 00:36:09.331
FR-2:

690
00:36:09.611 --> 00:36:14.133
List my orders, newest first (GET or api or v1 or orders).

691
00:36:14.413 --> 00:36:15.395
FR-3:

692
00:36:15.675 --> 00:36:19.536
Get an order (GET or api or v1 or orders/id).

693
00:36:19.816 --> 00:36:20.797
FR-4:

694
00:36:21.077 --> 00:36:27.947
Cancel an order before packing (POST or api or v1 or orders/id/cancel).

695
00:36:28.227 --> 00:36:29.272
NFR-1:

696
00:36:29.552 --> 00:36:37.232
Every mutating call requires Idempotency-Key; a duplicate never creates a second order (verified under concurrency).

697
00:36:37.512 --> 00:36:38.557
NFR-2:

698
00:36:38.837 --> 00:36:43.296
List p99 at most 150 ms at any page depth.

699
00:36:43.576 --> 00:36:44.643
NFR-3:

700
00:36:44.923 --> 00:36:48.549
Cancel requires If-Match; stale, then 412.

701
00:36:48.829 --> 00:36:49.917
NFR-4:

702
00:36:50.197 --> 00:36:54.656
All errors are application or problem+json with a stable code.

703
00:36:56.006 --> 00:36:57.051
NFR-5:

704
00:36:57.331 --> 00:37:01.129
No breaking change within v1; enforced by CI diff.

