786
00:40:52.907 --> 00:40:55.531
Decision (ADR-020 summary).

787
00:40:55.811 --> 00:41:09.379
All mutating customer and seller APIs require an Idempotency-Key, scoped per client, fingerprinted, stored in the same database and transaction as the business effect, and retained for 24 hours.

788
00:41:09.659 --> 00:41:16.357
In-progress duplicates get 409 with Retry-After, and mismatched bodies get 422.

