Webhooks:

1179
01:04:02.698 --> 01:04:15.989
HMAC signatures, timestamp tolerance, secrets in a vault, TLS-only URLs, and SSRF protection when sellers register URLs (block private IP ranges and metadata endpoints).

1180
01:04:16.269 --> 01:04:21.261
Problem Details never include stack traces, SQL or internal hostnames.

1181
01:04:21.541 --> 01:04:28.645
Rate limits and quotas per client (Ch 18, 39), with 429 + Retry-After.

