1200
01:05:06.181 --> 01:05:06.949
Value:

1201
01:05:07.229 --> 01:05:08.381
24 h.

1202
01:05:08.661 --> 01:05:13.717
Guidance: ≥ the longest client retry horizon (offline apps).

1203
01:05:13.997 --> 01:05:15.256
Response compression.

1204
01:05:15.536 --> 01:05:18.651
Value: gzip or br above ~1 KB.

1205
01:05:18.931 --> 01:05:19.827
Guidance:

1206
01:05:20.107 --> 01:05:21.792
Payload versus CPU.

1207
01:05:22.072 --> 01:05:23.203
ETag for GETs.

1208
01:05:23.483 --> 01:05:24.251
Value:

1209
01:05:24.531 --> 01:05:26.429
From version, not body hash.

1210
01:05:26.709 --> 01:05:27.605
Guidance:

1211
01:05:27.885 --> 01:05:30.637
Cheap to compute; enables 304.

1212
01:05:31.987 --> 01:05:33.097
Webhook timeout.

1213
01:05:33.377 --> 01:05:34.145
Value:

1214
01:05:34.425 --> 01:05:36.515
3 s connect or 10 s read.

1215
01:05:36.795 --> 01:05:37.691
