1489
01:24:30.557 --> 01:24:31.623
Exercise:

1490
01:24:31.903 --> 01:24:35.871
Write the Spectral ruleset for your platform's top 10 API rules.

1491
01:24:36.151 --> 01:24:36.834
Hint:

1492
01:24:37.114 --> 01:24:38.479
Start from §2.

1493
01:24:38.759 --> 01:24:39.634
B4.

1494
01:24:39.914 --> 01:24:40.981
Exercise:

1495
01:24:41.261 --> 01:24:43.309
Draft ADR-022:

1496
01:24:43.589 --> 01:24:49.285
GraphQL federation versus BFFs for the customer apps in 2027.

1497
01:24:49.565 --> 01:24:50.247
Hint:

1498
01:24:50.527 --> 01:24:52.447
Team topology, cost limits.

1499
01:24:53.797 --> 01:24:54.800
Further reading.

1500
01:24:55.080 --> 01:25:12.616
RFC 9110 (HTTP Semantics), RFC 9457 (Problem Details), RFC 9745 (Deprecation header), RFC 8594 (Sunset header).

1501
01:25:12.896 --> 01:25:14.176
